    },
    {
      "excerpt": "研究文件",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究文件、监查和管理",
        "研究文件"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1271"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 31340,
      "source_ref": "body.p1271",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1271"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-2474180756190e10d5c30df7",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "研究者必须保存足够且准确的记录，以便完整记录研究的执行过程，包括但不限于方案、方案修正案、知情同意书和IRB/EC与政府批准文件。此外，在研究结束时，研究者可以获得该中心的参与者数据，包括含有所有数据变更完整记录的稽查跟踪数据。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究文件、监查和管理",
        "研究文件"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1272"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 31350,
      "source_ref": "body.p1272",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1272"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-3908af6fdec8534b36ed207a",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "研究开始时，研究中心、分析检测单位、申办者三方均应各自建立研究文件的档案管理。研究结束时，监查员必须审核确认各研究中心、分析检测单位、申办者各自的文件，这些文件必须被妥善的保存在各自的临床研究档案卷宗内。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究文件、监查和管理",
        "研究文件"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1273"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 31360,
      "source_ref": "body.p1273",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1273"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-76d089e04fe2391d60f75717",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "方案偏离",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究文件、监查和管理",
        "方案偏离"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1274"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 31370,
      "source_ref": "body.p1274",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1274"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-a2cc70a977b5bfd5c4aa99c3",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "研究方案中规定的所有要求，必须严格执行。任何有意或无意偏离试验方案和GCP原则的行为，均可归类为偏离方案。临床监查员在监查过程中，如果发现偏离方案时应填写偏离方案记录，详细记录事件发生的时间、过程、原因、相应的处理措施等适用项，由研究者签字，并通报伦理委员会及申办者。在数据统计和总结报告中，研究者对发生的方案偏离对最终数据和结论的影响进行分析和报告。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究文件、监查和管理",
        "方案偏离"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1275"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 31380,
      "source_ref": "body.p1275",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1275"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-ac2dd3d0da9edcf360065d0a",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "所有方案偏离情况必须记录在源文件中。所有方案偏离必须按照伦理委员会规定递交以供审查。研究者有责任知悉并遵行伦理委员会相关规定。当发生严重方案偏离时，应进行评估。必要时，参与者需退出研究。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究文件、监查和管理",
        "方案偏离"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1276"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 31390,
      "source_ref": "body.p1276",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1276"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-4d3c44d679efa6ca3ba77ddd",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "现场监查/检查",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究文件、监查和管理",
        "现场监查/检查"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1277"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 31400,
      "source_ref": "body.p1277",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1277"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-ed070d71913fa907125ce547",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "研究中心访视将由申办者或授权的代表进行研究数据、参与者病历和eCRFs的监查。研究者将允许国家和地方卫生当局、申办者监查员、代表和合作者，以及IRB/EC检查与本研究相关的设施和记录。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究文件、监查和管理",
        "现场监查/检查"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1278"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 31410,
      "source_ref": "body.p1278",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1278"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-66c3ad07a87c52a0c15a183c",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "管理结构",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究文件、监查和管理",
        "管理结构"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
        "body.p1279"
      ],
      "phase_scopes": [
        "unknown"
      ],
      "priority_keyword_hits": [],
      "priority_rank": 0,
      "schema_version": "phase5/v1",
      "source_order": 31420,
      "source_ref": "body.p1279",
      "source_span_ids": [
        "body.p1279"
      ],
      "structure_unit_id": "su-4864eb2b59443c09eac01bf9",
      "study_phase": "phase_ii",
      "table_context": null,
      "unit_kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "excerpt": "申办者或其代理人将执行项目管理、研究管理、监查、供应商管理和统计编程。可使用IWRS进行参与者筛查和随机分组，以及研究药物申请和运输的管理。研究中心将负责生物样品在运输至申办者或其指定分析单位之前的保存。数据将使用eCRFs通过EDC系统记录，或以电子方式转发给申办者（例如，药代动力学数据）。",
      "heading_path": [
        "研究文件、监查和管理",
        "管理结构"
      ],
      "is_footnote_or_note": false,
      "member_source_refs": [
